<section class="context-section" aria-labelledby="context-heading"><div class="container context-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Connections, not silos</p><h2 id="context-heading">One platform.<br />One business<br /><em>context.</em></h2><p>Serga connects the records most businesses keep separate.</p><p>A contract belongs to a supplier. A leased asset belongs to a location. A subscription belongs to a customer. A service connects a provider with a customer.</p><p>Serga keeps those relationships together — so you see the business context, not just another record.</p><a class="text-link" href="/platform">Meet the platform <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="context-map" role="img" aria-label="Organizations, including customers and suppliers, connect to people, locations and assets through agreements, services and workflows."><div class="map-root">Organizations</div><div class="map-branches"><span>People</span><span>Locations</span><span>Assets</span></div><div class="map-center">Agreements</div><div class="map-step">Services</div><div class="map-step map-final">Workflows <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><p>A shared foundation for every relationship.</p></div></div></section>
